WEBVTT

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.680
The St. Paulia Academy's annual festival is almost here.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:49.510
And all the kids are getting ready.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:52.350
Hanging decorations, getting their costumes together.

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:54.010
It's a fun time of year.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:55.450
And not just because traditionally

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:59.170
there's a lot less homework.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:00.000
There's another tradition

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.030
that goes with the festival even more exciting than less homework at least to

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.560
the girls

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.740
get your heart out

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:11.560
this came off Mikami's locker

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.320
that's Mikami's padlock?

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:15.840
yup and you know where it's going now

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.700
Mamie what's going on?

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.120
what's up with the padlock?

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.330
oh boy

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:26.520
Sarah you really haven't got a clue when it comes to romance

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.000
listen up because I'm only going to explain this once

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:33.370
It's an ancient tradition that if you take a boy's combination lock from his locker

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.370
and put it up on the fence on the roof,

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:39.280
he has to dance with you on the last night of the festival.

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.880
Oh, so that's why I've seen all those locks up there.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.670
Bingo!

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:47.810
It's a symbol for your heart and his being locked together as one.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:52.960
Of course, the problem is getting the boy's padlock to start with.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:56.800
Oh, I know! Maybe you could ask Yamamoto for me, what do you think?

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:59.190
Me? No way!

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.000
Okay.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:08.880
where do you want us to hang it? Junior, I wonder. He's probably got girls standing

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:16.040
in line to get his padlock. Hey, Junior, do me a favor and stand on this, will ya?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:20.700
All right, but why? Now, pull it up! Get him!

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:30.000
Here we go! One Junior in a bag coming up! Very funny! Now, come on, get me out of here before I

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:54.770
get mad. Then again, maybe not. If you have some kind of problem, you can tell me. Really,

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:58.200
I'd like to try and help you if you'll let me. Well...

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:07.000
You see, Sarah, I mean, I guess I should call you Sister Sarah.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.930
Do you know how a girl gets a boy to dance with her at the festival?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:16.440
Uh, sure, but if you'd asked me yesterday, I wouldn't have.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:24.200
This friend of mine, she was too shy to ask this boy she likes for his padlock, so she asked me to do it, and I said I would.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:30.000
Big mistake, because when I went to see him, who showed up but that guy Sawatari, editor of

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:47.710
the school paper huh who's there nice job you guys that was really beautiful

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:55.340
hey where are you going saw Atari wait huh what are you planning to do with

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:59.120
that picture anyway it's going in the school paper it's good enough to make

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.000
the front page I think

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:05.720
think I've even thought of a caption for it one couple finding the combination to

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:10.240
love what do you think you like it but you can't I wasn't getting it for me I

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.280
was just helping a friend sorry but that's not my problem besides I wouldn't

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:24.620
have room for all that in the caption saw Atari it's awful you see I've already

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:30.000
got a boyfriend Sarah and of course my friend will think I betrayed her oh what a mess

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.590
I don't know what to do!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:35.320
What a creep!

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:41.770
Ever since that guy got to be editor of the paper, all he ever thinks about is getting a story!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.720
Hmm...

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:47.630
