00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.460
Our problem is finding a way to get that picture back.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.830
Don't you worry, Sarah. I'm gonna teach that stuck-up jerk a lesson.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.880
In fact, this is one job that I'm gonna really enjoy!

00:05:58.880 --> 00:05:59.670
Hmm...

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:03.450
That's all very well and good, but try to keep in mind that we haven't got a lot of time.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:08.250
We've got to get it before he can print it, or better yet, before he develops it and makes copies.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.590
All right, but when do you think would be the best time to do the job?

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:12.650
Well, let's see.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.570
The festival's the day after tomorrow.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.430
There'll be a lot of kids in confusion, and that might be a good time.

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:21.920
The festival, of course, with everyone dressed up in the most outrageous costumes.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:23.860
Yes, it's the perfect time to do it.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:25.250
Huh?

