00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.200
The lighting, the framing, everything.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.000
And then that piece of junk got into the picture and destroyed it.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.310
the whole feeling.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.300
Huh.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.650
Hey you, watch who you're calling a piece of junk.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.820
