00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:38.760
Hey.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.590
When did he get so macho?

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.200
Junior, you mind not pulling so hard?

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.700
You're cutting off my circulation.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.280
So what was that?

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.780
How come you couldn't just tell that guy to go jump in a lake?

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:56.160
You never seem to have any problem telling me off.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:56.600
Why?

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.250
I mean, me, you're hitting the head with a broomstick.

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:00.000
Why's that?

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:02.870
I wonder...

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:03.860
What?

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.980
So maybe it's like she doesn't hate me after all.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.250
Could it be he's starting to get it?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:41.350
- It looks like that padlock thing actually worked.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:42.430
- Oh, make her pay.

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:43.870
Who does she think she is, huh?

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.030
If she thinks I'm just gonna take this lying down,

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:47.650
she's got another thing coming.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:49.960
Pay.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:51.030
Oh, oh, oh.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:33.610
Gou-chan took his pet ball.

00:22:33.610 --> 00:22:39.170
Gou-chan will move on Christmas day, so I want you to come back to Tama by then.

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.600
Asuka Jr. went to Gou-chan's place without me giving a notice,

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:48.380
so I'm going to go on TV and announce the identity of Saint Tail to the whole town.

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.760
Next time, I'm going home.

00:22:50.760 --> 00:22:52.870
"Santa at the store!"

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:56.530
May everyone have the protection of the gods!
